18.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/are-there-two-celestes-in-singer-d4vds-case-strange-theory-surfaces-over-death-of-15-year-old-la-teen/articleshow/124031118.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/are-there-two-celestes-in-singer-d4vds-case-strange-theory-surfaces-over-death-of-15-year-old-la-teen/articleshow/124031118.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T23:05:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124031113,imgsize-65502.cms"/></item><item><title>'I wear his pendant': Erika Kirk remembers slain husband Charlie</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124030116.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-wear-his-pendant-erika-kirk-remembers-slain-husband-charlie-recalls-him-saying-he-could-face-a-violent-death/articleshow/124030116.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-wear-his-pendant-erika-kirk-remembers-slain-husband-charlie-recalls-him-saying-he-could-face-a-violent-death/articleshow/124030116.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T22:22:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124030435,imgsize-31582.cms"/></item><item><title>$100K for an H-1B Visa to work in the US? Why the UAE now makes more sense than ever</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124027626.cms" /&gt;As US H-1B visas skyrocket to $100,000, the American dream grows costly and precarious. Meanwhile, the UAE quietly crafts a structured, long-term talent ecosystem: Golden, Green, and Blue visas, zero income tax, world-class infrastructure, and cosmopolitan cities like Dubai and Abu Dhabi. For global professionals, it’s no mere alternative, it’s a pragmatic, opportunity-rich stage where ambition meets stability.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/100k-for-an-h-1b-visa-to-work-in-the-us-why-the-uae-now-makes-more-sense-than-ever/articleshow/124027626.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/100k-for-an-h-1b-visa-to-work-in-the-us-why-the-uae-now-makes-more-sense-than-ever/articleshow/124027626.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T22:14:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124030333,imgsize-1637573.cms"/></item><item><title>'When I get to heaven...': Erika Kirk reveals she won't seek death penalty for Charlie Kirk's killer because...</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124030378.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/when-i-get-to-heaven-erika-kirk-reveals-she-wont-seek-death-penalty-for-charlie-kirks-killer-because-/articleshow/124030378.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/when-i-get-to-heaven-erika-kirk-reveals-she-wont-seek-death-penalty-for-charlie-kirks-killer-because-/articleshow/124030378.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T22:20:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124030407,imgsize-50900.cms"/></item><item><title>UAE: Dubai Ruler Sheikh Mohammed launches campaign to train 10,000 youth and create 30,000 jobs</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124029148.cms" /&gt;Under the guidance of Sheikh Mohammed bin Rashid Al Maktoum, the UAE government has introduced StartupEmirates.ae, an entrepreneurship initiative. This platform aims to train 10,000 young Emiratis and generate 30,000 jobs by 2030. It offers mentorship, training, co-working spaces, and funding, positioning the UAE as a global startup hub.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-dubai-ruler-sheikh-mohammed-launches-campaign-to-train-10000-youth-and-create30000jobs/articleshow/124029148.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-dubai-ruler-sheikh-mohammed-launches-campaign-to-train-10000-youth-and-create30000jobs/articleshow/124029148.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T20:30:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124029424,imgsize-1436410.cms"/></item><item><title>Syria to hold first parliamentary election after over 5 decades of dictatorship- What you need to know</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124029674.cms" /&gt;Syria is set to conduct its initial parliamentary election under the new administration on October 5, as announced by the state news agency SANA. Prior to the election, the deadline for submitting appeals against members of the electoral bodies was extended until September 21.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/syria-to-hold-first-parliamentary-election-after-over-5-decades-of-dictatorship-what-you-need-to-know/articleshow/124029674.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/syria-to-hold-first-parliamentary-election-after-over-5-decades-of-dictatorship-what-you-need-to-know/articleshow/124029674.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T21:15:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124029812,imgsize-46768.cms"/></item><item><title>Sky Meadow Country Club shooting: Victim Robert DeCesare's mother narrates how her son was killed by Hunter Nadeau</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124029734.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sky-meadow-country-club-shooting-victim-robert-decesares-mother-narrates-how-her-son-was-killed-by-hunter-nadeau/articleshow/124029734.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sky-meadow-country-club-shooting-victim-robert-decesares-mother-narrates-how-her-son-was-killed-by-hunter-nadeau/articleshow/124029734.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T21:08:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124029744,imgsize-24128.cms"/></item><item><title>'Hope for peace': UK, Canada, Australia recognise Palestinian state; back two-state solution</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124028577.cms" /&gt;In a historic move, UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer announced Britain's formal recognition of a Palestinian state, aiming to revive peace prospects. Despite opposition from the US and Israel, Starmer defends the decision as crucial for ending the Gaza conflict and fostering lasting peace. Deputy PM David Lammy emphasized it keeps the two-state solution alive, correcting a historical injustice.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/hope-for-peace-uk-canada-australia-recognise-palestinian-state-back-two-state-solution/articleshow/124028577.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/hope-for-peace-uk-canada-australia-recognise-palestinian-state-back-two-state-solution/articleshow/124028577.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T19:17:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124028844,imgsize-908331.cms"/></item></channel></rss>